  },
  "problem": {
    "source": "",
    "keyPoints": {
      "title": "解题要点",
      "lead": "",
      "items": [
        "观察原式结构：由条件确认 \\(a-1，b-1\\) 为正，并识别目标中的两个完整分母",
        "整体换元：令 \\(x=a-1>0，y=b-1>0\\)，同步改写条件与目标，得到 \\(xy=1\\) 和 \\(13+\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\)",
        "观察换元后的结构：常数 \\(13\\) 不动；两个正项 \\(\\frac{4}{x}\\)、\\(\\frac{9}{y}\\) 的乘积固定为 \\(36\\)",
        "应用基本不等式：\\(\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\ge12\\)，所以原目标不小于 \\(25\\)",
        "验证取等并还原：\\(x=\\frac{2}{3}，y=\\frac{3}{2}\\)，对应 \\(a=\\frac{5}{3}，b=\\frac{5}{2}\\)"
      ]
    },
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "已知 \\(a>0，b>0\\)，且 \\(\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}=1\\)，求 \\(\\frac{4a}{a-1}+\\frac{9b}{b-1}\\) 的最小值。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "观察原式结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "条件整式",
          "expression": "\\(a>0，b>0，\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}=1\\)",
          "tag": "可推出 a−1>0，b−1>0"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "目标整式",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{4a}{a-1}+\\frac{9b}{b-1}\\)",
          "tag": "两个完整分母"
        },
        "organization": {
          "substitutionHint": {
            "mappings": [
              {
                "numerator": "\\(4a\\)",
                "denominator": "\\(a-1\\)",
                "variable": "\\(x\\)",
                "assignment": "\\(a-1>0\\)"
              },
              {
                "numerator": "\\(9b\\)",
                "denominator": "\\(b-1\\)",
                "variable": "\\(y\\)",
                "assignment": "\\(b-1>0\\)"
              }
            ],
            "ariaLabel": "识别目标中的两个完整分母 a 减 1 与 b 减 1，分别令 x 与 y 整体换元"
          }
        },
        "reading": "完整分母",
        "route": "整体换元"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "由 \\(\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}=1\\) 且 \\(a，b>0\\)，得 \\(a>1，b>1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(a-1>0，b-1>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "目标的两个分母分别是完整整式 \\(a-1\\)、\\(b-1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "可对两个完整分母分别整体换元"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "路线判断",
          "完整分母整体换元"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "整体换元",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "showFocus": false,
        "condition": {
          "label": "原条件",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{b}=1\\)"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "原目标",
          "expression": "\\(\\frac{4a}{a-1}+\\frac{9b}{b-1}\\)"
        },
        "organization": {
          "label": "整体换元：定义域、条件与目标同步改写",
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": "定义与逆关系",
              "expression": "\\(x=a-1>0，y=b-1>0；a=x+1，b=y+1\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "改写条件",
              "expression": "\\(\\frac{1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{y+1}=1\\Rightarrow xy=1\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "整理两项",
              "expression": "\\(\\frac{4(x+1)}{x}=4+\\frac{4}{x}，\\frac{9(y+1)}{y}=9+\\frac{9}{y}\\)"
            },
            {
              "label": "改写目标",
              "expression": "\\(13+\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\)"
            }
          ]
        },
        "reading": "完成换元与整理",
        "route": "重新观察结构"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "令 \\(x=a-1>0，y=b-1>0\\)，则 \\(a=x+1，b=y+1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "原条件改写为 \\(\\frac{1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{y+1}=1\\)，整理得 \\(xy=1\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "原目标改写为 \\(\\frac{4(x+1)}{x}+\\frac{9(y+1)}{y}=13+\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "换元结果",
          "xy=1｜目标为 13+4/x+9/y"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "观察换元后的结构",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-structure-scan",
        "condition": {
          "label": "条件整式",
          "expression": "\\(xy=1\\)",
          "tag": "定积"
        },
        "target": {
          "label": "目标整式",
          "expression": "\\(13+\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\)",
          "tag": "常数 13 不动"
        },
        "pattern": {
          "first": {
            "value": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}\\)",
            "shape": "square"
          },
          "second": {
            "value": "\\(\\frac{9}{y}\\)",
            "shape": "circle"
          },
          "condition": {
            "operator": "·",
            "tag": "定积 36"
          },
          "target": {
            "operator": "+",
            "tag": "求最小值"
          },
          "ariaLabel": "换元后，同一组正项 4 比 x 与 9 比 y 的积固定为 36，求和的最小值"
        },
        "reading": "定积求和",
        "route": "直接应用基本不等式"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "常数 \\(13\\) 不影响最小值的位置，只需研究两个正项 \\(\\frac{4}{x}\\)、\\(\\frac{9}{y}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "由 \\(xy=1\\)，得 \\(\\frac{4}{x}\\cdot\\frac{9}{y}=\\frac{36}{xy}=36\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "这是「定积求和」，直接应用基本不等式"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "结构判断",
          "定积求和｜直接应用"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "应用基本不等式",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-mapping",
        "methodTag": "直接应用｜定积求和",
        "templateLabel": "代入基本不等式",
        "template": "\\(u+v\\ge2\\sqrt{uv}\\)",
        "formulaStyle": "sum-geometric",
        "showPositiveStep": true,
        "mappings": [
          {
            "slot": "第一个正项",
            "shape": "square",
            "value": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}\\)",
            "condition": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}>0\\)"
          },
          {
            "slot": "第二个正项",
            "shape": "circle",
            "value": "\\(\\frac{9}{y}\\)",
            "condition": "\\(\\frac{9}{y}>0\\)"
          }
        ],
        "mappedSum": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\)",
        "mappedProduct": "\\(36\\)",
        "mapped": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\ge2\\sqrt{36}\\)",
        "stageLabel": "代入定积",
        "fixedSourceLabel": "已知",
        "fixedSourceTarget": "product",
        "fixedCondition": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}\\cdot\\frac{9}{y}=36\\)",
        "replacementText": "把乘积换成 36",
        "replaced": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\ge12\\)",
        "simplifyLabel": "加上保留的常数 13",
        "substituted": "\\(13+\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\ge25\\)",
        "conclusionLabel": "得到原目标下界",
        "conclusion": "\\(\\frac{4a}{a-1}+\\frac{9b}{b-1}\\ge25\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}>0，\\frac{9}{y}>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\ge2\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{x}\\cdot\\frac{9}{y}}=12\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(13+\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{9}{y}\\ge25\\)"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "下界",
          "25"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "section": "换元法",
      "title": "验证取等并还原",
      "t": 0,
      "showDiagram": false,
      "visual": {
        "kind": "basic-inequality-equality-check",
        "templateLabel": "基本不等式取等",
        "first": {
          "value": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}\\)",
          "shape": "square"
        },
        "second": {
          "value": "\\(\\frac{9}{y}\\)",
          "shape": "circle"
        },
        "conditionLabel": "结合新条件并还原",
        "condition": "\\(xy=1，a=x+1，b=y+1\\)",
        "solved": "\\(x=\\frac{2}{3}，y=\\frac{3}{2}\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{5}{3}，b=\\frac{5}{2}\\)",
        "verificationLabel": "代回原目标",
        "verification": "\\(\\frac{4a}{a-1}+\\frac{9b}{b-1}=25\\)",
        "conclusion": "原式的最小值为 \\(25\\)"
      },
      "reasoning": [
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "基本不等式取等 ⇔ 两个正项相等"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{4}{x}=\\frac{9}{y}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "\\(xy=1，x>0，y>0\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "\\(x=\\frac{2}{3}，y=\\frac{3}{2}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "由 \\(a=x+1，b=y+1\\)，得 \\(a=\\frac{5}{3}，b=\\frac{5}{2}\\)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "therefore",
          "text": "代回原式得 \\(25\\)，故最小值可以取得"
        }
      ],
      "derive": [
        [
          "最小值",
          "25"
        ],
        [
